  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme support to LACEEP. Latin America and Caribbean  Environmental Economics Program, which is an Environmental Economics programme with CATIE in Costa Rica as host institution. The support includes competitive research grants, extensive use of workshops to work with the researchers, and shorter courses. The support to LACEEP is a suppport for social science research.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programst&#xf6;d till LACEEP - Latin America and Caribbean Environmental Economics Program, som &#xe4;r ett milj&#xf6;ekonomiprogram med CATIE i Costa Rica som v&#xe4;rdinstitution. St&#xf6;det inkluderar konkurrensutsatta forskningsst&#xf6;d, resursintensiva workshops, samt kurser. St&#xf6;det till LACEEP h&#xf6;r hemma inom st&#xf6;d till samh&#xe4;llsvetenskaplig forskning.</narrative>
